{"id":"n91572-1-7","stage":3,"title":"점퍼 · 夹克","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91572-1-7-1","ko":"양복을 입고 청소를 하겠다고요?","zh":"你要穿西装去打扫吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"양복을","meaning":"西装","explanation":"양복：西装；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"양복","audio":"/audio/c7bd572874f1f999bedd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73257","senseId":"1","lemma":"양복","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"양복을","audio":"/audio/581e2a4f1001de358e15.mp3"}},{"text":"입고","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입고","audio":"/audio/abf4f911317e9d7bed28.mp3"}},{"text":"청소를","meaning":"打扫，清扫，扫除","explanation":"청소：打扫，清扫，扫除；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"청소","audio":"/audio/8049e4b9139d36bf5db4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32789","senseId":"1","lemma":"청소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"청소를","audio":"/audio/34e25f83dc2e31e6efd2.mp3"}},{"text":"하겠다고요?","meaning":"做（청소를 하다：打扫）","explanation":"하다：做（청소를 하다：打扫）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；다고：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하겠다고요","audio":"/audio/2fe14b7d0030627cc42a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c7bd572874f1f999","term":"양복","zh":"西装","audio":"/audio/c7bd572874f1f999bedd.mp3","entryId":"73257","definition":"成年男子的西洋式正装。","pronunciation":["양복"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]},{"id":"8049e4b9139d36bf","term":"청소","zh":"打扫，清扫，扫除","audio":"/audio/8049e4b9139d36bf5db4.mp3","entryId":"32789","definition":"清除肮脏杂乱的东西。","pronunciation":["청소"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做（청소를 하다：打扫）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做（청소를 하다：打扫）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cd6c009b246441bf1db2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91572-1-7-2","ko":"그럼 편한 점퍼 차림으로 갈아입고 올게요.","zh":"那我换上舒适的夹克再去吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"편한","meaning":"舒服，舒畅","explanation":"편하다：舒服，舒畅；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"편하다","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71334","senseId":"1","lemma":"편하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"편한","audio":"/audio/1fefca8bff3d77728020.mp3"}},{"text":"점퍼","meaning":"夹克","explanation":"점퍼：夹克。","readings":[{"term":"점퍼","audio":"/audio/db573e5c4827585b31d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91572","senseId":"1","lemma":"점퍼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"점퍼","audio":"/audio/db573e5c4827585b31d4.mp3"}},{"text":"차림으로","meaning":"穿戴，衣着，着装","explanation":"차림：穿戴，衣着，着装；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"차림","audio":"/audio/d7aad0e0bdea006a462c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37239","senseId":"1","lemma":"차림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차림으로","audio":"/audio/17dddad1e0d56534c62e.mp3"}},{"text":"갈아입고","meaning":"换，换穿","explanation":"갈아입다：换，换穿；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"갈아입다","audio":"/audio/83e13541ecbec8ff35d7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53830","senseId":"1","lemma":"갈아입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈아입고","audio":"/audio/e261947ebcbbc674f70a.mp3